Package: com.551.alltrailsapptweak
Name: AllTrailsLinkFix
Version: 2.1.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Fixes shared AllTrails trail links so they open the exact trail directly in AllTrails instead of only launching the app. Made specifically for the premium-unlocked AllTrails 23.2.40 IPA on rootless iOS 16. The matching IPA will be placed in GitHub Releases alongside the DEB.
